{"id":"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADRw==","name":"Handle Tiny Piles Like a K1ng","description":"Don't you hate having to manually compress all those tiny piles? Well, let me show you how to automate that. A combination of type filter, chest buffer (or super buffer in HV) and packager frees you from that annoying task. The chest buffer can hold up to 9 stacks of tiny piles and the super buffer can hold 256 stacks of tiny dusts, which is more than enough. You can set its mode with a screwdriver on the output side. Set it to 9 to export 9 tiny piles at a time and let the packager compress these into regular dusts.\n\n[note]When you unlock them, Super buffers can be lag sources, so be careful to keep them as empty as possible. If you end up using a multiblock packager, be sure to change the buffer from Stocking mode to Transfer Size mode.[/note]","icon":{"Count":1,"Damage":32498,"OreDict":"","id":"gregtech:gt.metaitem.01","resolved":{"id":"i:gregtech:gt.metaitem.01:32498","name":"Schematic (Dusts)","mod":"gregtech","registry":"gt.metaitem.01","icon":40922,"nbt":null,"kind":"item","unit":"items","damage":32498,"shard":"ad6cd39057a79e9b","recipes":1},"label":"Schematic (Dusts)"},"prerequisites":["AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAXA=="],"tasks":{"0":{"autoConsume":0,"consume":0,"groupDetect":0,"ignoreNBT":1,"index":0,"partialMatch":1,"requireOnlyOneItem":0,"requiredItems":{"0":{"Count":1,"Damage":9251,"OreDict":"","id":"gregtech:gt.blockmachines","resolved":{"id":"i:gregtech:gt.blockmachines:9251","name":"Low Voltage Type Filter","mod":"gregtech","registry":"gt.blockmachines","icon":25666,"nbt":null,"kind":"item","unit":"items","damage":9251,"shard":"4822957191b27bb6","recipes":1},"label":"Low Voltage Type Filter"}},"taskID":"bq_standard:retrieval"},"1":{"autoConsume":0,"consume":0,"groupDetect":0,"ignoreNBT":1,"index":1,"partialMatch":1,"requireOnlyOneItem":0,"requiredItems":{"0":{"Count":1,"Damage":9231,"OreDict":"","id":"gregtech:gt.blockmachines","resolved":{"id":"i:gregtech:gt.blockmachine